@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+---
+id: task-001-add-stable-task-identifiers
+type: task
+title: "Add stable task identifiers"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Give each task in a list a unique, stable string `id`. Return it from `add` and expose `get(id)`
+with the same result shape as the list's other methods. Let `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`,
+`tag`, `untag`, and `remove` accept a task ID as well as a title, so callers can keep referring to
+a task after its title changes.
